<title>FRANCE: BNP welcomes Axa, UAP merger.</title>
<headline>BNP welcomes Axa, UAP merger.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Nationale de Paris said on Tuesday it welcomed the planned merger of French insurers Axa and UAP.</p>
<p>&quot;BNP welcomes the creation of this group, a world leader in the insurance industry,&quot; BNP said in a statement.</p>
<p>BNP owns 17.2 percent of UAP.</p>
<p>UAP Chairman Jacques Friedmann said at a news conference earlier on Tuesday that BNP chairman Michel Pebereau had been kept informed of the deal from the beginning.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
